{
  "name": "Configurar Webhook Evolution (ejecutar 1 vez)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuración inicial (una sola vez)\n\n1. Edita el nodo `Datos de Conexión` con la URL de Evolution API, la instancia, la API key y la URL pública del webhook de n8n (la del workflow principal, en modo **Producción**: termina en `/webhook/evolution-whatsapp`).\n2. Pulsa **Execute Workflow**.\n3. Evolution API empezará a enviar todos los mensajes entrantes al workflow principal.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Instrucciones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "Ejecutar Manualmente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-140, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-01",
              "name": "evolution_url",
              "value": "http://evolution-api:8080",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-02",
              "name": "evolution_instancia",
              "value": "principal",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-03",
              "name": "evolution_apikey",
              "value": "CAMBIA_ESTA_API_KEY",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-04",
              "name": "webhook_n8n",
              "value": "http://n8n:5678/webhook/evolution-whatsapp",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "datos-conexion",
      "name": "Datos de Conexión",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [80, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.evolution_url }}/webhook/set/{{ $json.evolution_instancia }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $json.evolution_apikey }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ webhook: { enabled: true, url: $json.webhook_n8n, byEvents: false, base64: false, events: ['MESSAGES_UPSERT'] } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "configurar-webhook",
      "name": "Configurar Webhook en Evolution",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [300, 100]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Ejecutar Manualmente": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Datos de Conexión", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Datos de Conexión": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Configurar Webhook en Evolution", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
  }
}
